{"step_index":790,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T23:16:07Z","input_tokens":3159,"cache_read_tokens":228836,"output_tokens":321,"content":"I investigated the modal positioning:\n\n### Root Cause\nThe confirmation modal was rendering at the bottom because `teacher.html` was missing the `.warn` fixed overlay styles (`position: fixed; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 999`), and the modal was nested inside `.wrap` instead of directly under `<body>`.\n\n### Proposed Fix\n1. **[teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)**:\n   - Add the `.warn` fixed overlay CSS to center the dialog horizontally and vertically on screen over a dark backdrop.\n   - Hoist `<div id=\"confirm-modal\">` directly under `<body>` to span the full viewport.\n2. **[HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md)**:\n   - Append Non-Major Patch 1.0.18 per Rule 1.\n\nPlease review the [implementation plan](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) and reply with **\"proceed\"** (or click the Proceed button) so I can implement this fix."}
